  "offerings": [
    {
      "uuid": "f3000000000000000000000000000001",
      "name": "GPU Training Cluster",
      "type": "Marketplace.Basic",
      "state": 2,
      "shared": true,
      "billable": true,
      "category_uuid": "d3000000000000000000000000000001",
      "customer_uuid": "b3000000000000000000000000000001",
      "description": "NVIDIA A100 GPU cluster for model training",
      "plugin_options": {
        "service_provider_can_create_offering_user": true
      },
      "getting_started": "## Getting Started with GPU Training Cluster\n\n### Access\n```\nssh username@gpu-cluster.aiplatform.com\n```\n\n### Environment Setup\n```bash\n# Load CUDA and Python\nmodule load cuda/12.0 python/3.11\n\n# Activate your conda environment\nconda activate myenv\n\n# Check GPU availability\nnvidia-smi\n```\n\n### Job Submission (SLURM)\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n#SBATCH --gres=gpu:a100:4\n#SBATCH --time=48:00:00\n\npython train_model.py\n```\n\n### Best Practices\n- Use mixed precision training (FP16/BF16)\n- Enable gradient checkpointing for large models\n- Use distributed training for multi-GPU workloads"
    },
    {
      "uuid": "f3000000000000000000000000000002",
      "name": "ML Dataset Storage",
      "type": "Marketplace.Basic",
      "state": 2,
      "shared": true,
      "billable": true,
      "category_uuid": "d3000000000000000000000000000002",
      "customer_uuid": "b3000000000000000000000000000001",
      "description": "High-throughput storage for ML datasets and checkpoints",
      "getting_started": "## Getting Started with ML Dataset Storage\n\n### Storage Paths\n- **Datasets**: `/ml-storage/datasets/`\n- **Checkpoints**: `/ml-storage/checkpoints/`\n- **Models**: `/ml-storage/models/`\n\n### Data Loading\nUse our optimized PyTorch DataLoader:\n```python\nfrom ml_storage import FastDataLoader\n\nloader = FastDataLoader(\n    path='/ml-storage/datasets/imagenet',\n    batch_size=256,\n    num_workers=8\n)\n```\n\n### Checkpoint Management\n```python\nimport torch\ntorch.save(model.state_dict(), '/ml-storage/checkpoints/model_v1.pt')\n```\n\n### Performance Tips\n- Use memory-mapped files for large datasets\n- Prefetch data during training\n- Compress checkpoints with zstd"
    },
    {
      "uuid": "f3000000000000000000000000000010",
      "name": "AI/ML Kubernetes Cluster",
      "type": "Support.OfferingTemplate",
      "state": 2,
      "shared": true,
      "billable": true,
      "category_uuid": "d3000000000000000000000000000003",
      "customer_uuid": "b3000000000000000000000000000001",
      "description": "Kubernetes cluster optimized for AI/ML workloads with NVIDIA GPU operator, Kubeflow, and high-speed networking for distributed training.",
      "options": {
        "order": ["cluster_config"],
        "options": {
          "cluster_config": {
            "type": "single_datacenter_k8s_config",
