        "deployment_mode": "managed",
        "high_availability": true,
        "gpu_operator": true,
        "federated_learning": true,
        "model_registry": true,
        "service_provider_can_create_offering_user": true
      },
      "getting_started": "## Getting Started with Multi-Region AI Platform\n\n### Global Architecture\n- **Primary**: US-East (NVIDIA H100)\n- **Secondary**: EU-West (NVIDIA A100)\n- **Tertiary**: APAC (NVIDIA A100)\n\n### Access\n```\nexport KUBECONFIG=~/Downloads/kubeconfig-global-ai.yaml\nkubectl get nodes --label-columns=topology.kubernetes.io/region\n```\n\n### Federated Learning\n```yaml\napiVersion: fl.aiplatform.com/v1\nkind: FederatedLearningJob\nspec:\n  regions: [us-east, eu-west, apac]\n  aggregationStrategy: FedAvg\n```\n\n### Model Registry\nPush models to global registry for serving across regions.\n\n### Support\n24/7 AI Platform Support: ai-enterprise@aiplatform.com"
